Step 1.2: Load the CSV File
Load the CSV into a DataFrame with read_csv() and print its shape (rows, columns).

cat >> pandas_lab.py <<'EOF'

df = pd.read_csv('data.csv')
print("Shape before dropna:", df.shape)
EOF
python3 pandas_lab.py
Expected output:

Shape before dropna: (20, 4)
